# public/build IS committed, deliberately — Hostinger's Git auto-deploy only
# runs `composer install`, never `npm run build`, so the compiled assets
# must ship with the repo itself or every deploy leaves the site unstyled.
# Rebuild and commit before every push: `npm run build`.
